# Stage 9 golden tour (M7, D-036 style): the real game from the title with
# the run started in Café Zauner (`level = cafe_zauner`, the route's last
# station, D-047): START at frame 21, stage intro 21..170, then the inputs
# of cafe_zauner_solver.replay unchanged from frame 171 (re-copy them after
# `cargo xtask solve cafe_zauner --write`; the xtask tour coupling test
# checks it), then 3381 idle frames: the finale, the whole ending and the
# title with the „durchgespielt" mark (the replay ends there, 5830).
# Play frame = tour frame - 171 (stage clock likewise until the goal).
# The finale: the goal_stollen touched in the air (2449), the Serve after
# she lands, the tally (2544; its length follows the time left, so a new
# time_limit moves every later frame: re-pick the ending shots), the
# clear panel (2707), then the ending: Map 2887, Scene 3127, Bill 3487,
# Credits 4087 (6 pages of 180), Ende 5167, the title 5767.
# Shots, per section:
#   intro               60 „Etappe 9: Café Zauner"
#   1 Windfang          181 the glass door with the queue outside and the
#                       „Bus 150? / Wurscht!" board, 302 the tray bounce
#                       off Kellner #1 („Komm' gleich!")
#   2 Salon             475 chandeliers L1 and L2 over pens B and C
#   3 Die Schlange      686 the queue on its dots, mid-chain
#   4 Vor der Theke     892 the checkpoint („Zwischenstopp") beside
#                       „Reserviert / seit 1832"
#   5 Die Kuchentheke   1000 the arena lock, „Hinten anstellen!"; 1170 a
#                       dash (round 1, to the left wall); 1458 a breather
#                       stomp from the counter (hit 1, „Unerhört!"); 1760
#                       a volley (round 2, three bills); 2422 the third
#                       hit, the bell lifted („Bitte sehr!"); 2440 the bow
#   finale              2500 the Serve (the plate held up on the counter)
#   ending              3007 Map, 3327 Scene, 3700 Bill, 4357 Credits
#                       page 2 (the cast), 5287 Ende
#   title               5785 the marked title („Durchgespielt!
#                       Mahlzeit!", „Nochmal? Drück START", the Stollen
#                       at her feet; the run started in the café, so the
#                       title's backdrop is the café)
level  = cafe_zauner
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = complete frames=2449..2449 deaths=0 no_event=Hurt
expect = state=title cleared=true score=0 lives=3 oblaten=0 power=normal
shots  = 60:intro 181:door 302:tray_bounce 475:salon 686:queue 892:checkpoint 1000:anstellen 1170:dash 1458:breather_stomp 1760:volley 2422:bell 2440:bow 2500:serve 3007:ending_map 3327:ending_scene 3700:ending_bill 4357:credits 5287:ende 5785:title_cleared
